    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIDE OR DIE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls that Watch is a challenging retro horror game featuring innovative stealth gameplay. Equipped with a state-of-the-art radar detection system, you are tasked with navigating a labyrinthine world to reawaken a strange facility. Each of the three main levels offer a different environment with it's own story to tell.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two monsters in Walls that Watch are the same - you will have to learn how they work through trial and error. Your most valuable tool is your radar, use it to see enemies before they see you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724950/extras/94cc6976dcc8a024a63faae281c390af.avif?t=1749814855\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls that Watch is built to continually offer greater challenges to those who want it. Each level has a respective challenge mode, which applies a level specific modifier to make the level more interesting and frantic. Beat all the challenges to unlock a secret final mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724950/extras/e2f0d36e538c6c451229b9b309cb358d.avif?t=1749814855\" width=800 height=273 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIDE OR DIE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls that Watch is a challenging retro horror game featuring innovative stealth gameplay. Equipped with a state-of-the-art radar detection system, you are tasked with navigating a labyrinthine world to reawaken a strange facility. Each of the three main levels offer a different environment with it's own story to tell.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two monsters in Walls that Watch are the same - you will have to learn how they work through trial and error. Your most valuable tool is your radar, use it to see enemies before they see you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724950/extras/94cc6976dcc8a024a63faae281c390af.avif?t=1749814855\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls that Watch is built to continually offer greater challenges to those who want it. Each level has a respective challenge mode, which applies a level specific modifier to make the level more interesting and frantic. Beat all the challenges to unlock a secret final mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724950/extras/e2f0d36e538c6c451229b9b309cb358d.avif?t=1749814855\" width=800 height=273 /></span></p>",
